","n":14,"ssz":".............."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"獨張氏諸田無「恙」——ㄧㄤˋ，異樣","n":17,"ssz":"................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"課文中的商人把「不量」誤以為是「不良」，從而產生疑惑，這就是諧音雙關。請問下列何者造成誤解的原因與課文商人相同？","n":56,"ssz":"........1............................................1.."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"店員：「請問您是付清嗎?」；\n客人：「不、不，我是叔叔。」","n":29,"ssz":"..........................1.."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[0]#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"店員：「請問您是付清嗎?」；","n":14,"ssz":".............."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[0]#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"客人：「不、不，我是叔叔。」","n":14,"ssz":"...........1.."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"客人：「我買了這麼多，可以送我點什麼吧?」\n店員：「好的，我送您出去。」","n":36,"ssz":"...................................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[1]#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"客人：「我買了這麼多，可以送我點什麼吧?」","n":21,"ssz":"....................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[1]#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"店員：「好的，我送您出去。」","n":14,"ssz":".............."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"老師：「壽司是Sushi，那『握壽司』跟『散壽司』的英文怎麼說?」\n學生：「握壽司是Wow!Sushi.， 散壽司是s、u、s、h、i。」","n":69,"ssz":"....................................................................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[2]#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"老師：「壽司是Sushi，那『握壽司』跟『散壽司』的英文怎麼說?」","n":33,"ssz":"................................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[2]#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"學生：「握壽司是Wow!Sushi.， 散壽司是s、u、s、h、i。」","n":35,"ssz":"..................................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"老師：「寫功課時要多用點心，作業才寫得好。」\n學生：「點心可以吃麥當勞嗎?」","n":38,"ssz":"..................1.....