ull,"idx":null,"text":"人在做，天在看","n":7,"ssz":"......."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[4].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"謀事在人，成事在天","n":9,"ssz":"........."},{"section":"served:text_type","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"單","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.answer_carrier","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"橘色手寫代號與填空（run 層 w:color ＋ 字元樣式），文字流有此資訊","n":39,"ssz":"........1.............................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"在古代，「寫字」是一件很花錢的事，以致古人寫字時惜字如金，能省則省，但這往往造成我們閱讀文言文時產生困難，所以，如果我們能了解文言文省略了什麼，就比較能理解文章。\n文言文省略的成分很多，其中一種就是省略「主語」。但，主語是什麼？","n":114,"ssz":".............................................................1...........................1.....2.................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"在古代，「寫字」是一件很花錢的事，以致古人寫字時惜字如金，能省則省，但這往往造成我們閱讀文言文時產生困難，所以，如果我們能了解文言文省略了什麼，就比較能理解文章。","n":81,"ssz":".............................................................1..................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"文言文省略的成分很多，其中一種就是省略「主語」。但，主語是什麼？","n":32,"ssz":".......1.....2.................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"一、什麼是主語","n":7,"ssz":"......."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].value","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"主語是句子中做動作的人或物，或是句子所形容的對象","n":24,"ssz":"....1............1......"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].items[0].sub_label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"例1：哥哥在房間裡看書。","n":12,"ssz":"....1......."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].items[0].value","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"找到動詞，看書。\n「看書」的是「哥哥」，所以「哥哥」就是這個句子的主語。","n":36,"ssz":".................1......1....1.1...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].items[0].value#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"找到動詞，看書。","n":8,"ssz":"........"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].items[0].value#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"「看書」的是「哥哥」，所以「哥哥」就是這個句子的主語。","n":27,"ssz":"........1......1....1.1...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].items[1].sub_label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"例2：夏夜的景色真是美極了。","n":14,"ssz":".............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].items[1].value","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"找到形容詞，真是美極了。\n「真是美極了」的是「夏夜的景色」，所以「夏夜的景色」就是這個句子的主語。","n":49,"ssz":"..........................................1.1...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].items[1].value#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"找到形容詞，真是美極了。","n":12,"ssz":"............"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].items[1].value#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"「真是美極了」的是「夏夜的景色」，所以「夏夜的景色」就是這個句子的主語。","n":36,"ssz":".............................1.1...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].instruction","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"二、換你試試看！請選出下列各句的主語","n":18,"ssz":".................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].items[0].stem","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"微風輕輕地吹拂著。","n":9,"ssz":"....1...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].items[0].options.A","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"微風","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].items[0].options.B","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"吹拂著","n":3,"ssz":"..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].items[1].stem","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"人類的本性是善惡摻雜的。","n":12,"ssz":"............"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].items[1].options.A","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"人類","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].items[1].options.B","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"人類的本性","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].items[2].stem","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"月光多麼明亮皎潔。","n":9,"ssz":"........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].items[2].options.A","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"月光","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].items[2].options.B","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"明亮皎潔","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].items[3].stem","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"他是否缺席要確認一下。","n":11,"ssz":"........1.."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].items[3].options.A","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"他","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].items[3].options.B","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"他是否缺席","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"三、文言文主語的判讀方式\n　　現在，你已經知道什麼是主語了。回到主題，如何判斷省略主語的文言文句子，被省略的主語是什麼呢？如何「補回」?我們可以從中文的四個基本句型來思考：","n":86,"ssz":"................................................1............................1........"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"三、文言文主語的判讀方式","n":12,"ssz":"............"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"　　現在，你已經知道什麼是主語了。回到主題，如何判斷省略主語的文言文句子，被省略的主語是什麼呢？如何「補回」?我們可以從中文的四個基本句型來思考：","n":73,"ssz":"...................................1............................1........"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].instruction","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"　中文基本句型","n":7,"ssz":"......."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].columns[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"句型","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].columns[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"句型結構","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].columns[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"形式","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].columns[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"例句","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].rows[0][0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"敘事句","n":3,"ssz":"..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].rows[0][1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"主語+動詞","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].rows[0][2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"誰做什麼","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].rows[0][3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"哥哥在房間看書。","n":8,"ssz":".1......"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].rows[1][0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"表態句","n":3,"ssz":"..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].rows[1][1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"主語+形容詞","n":6,"ssz":"......"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].rows[1][2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"誰怎麼樣","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].rows[1][3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"天氣很熱。","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].rows[2][0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"有無句","n":3,"ssz":"..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].rows[2][1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"主語+有/沒有","n":7,"ssz":"......."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].rows[2][2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"誰有沒有","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].rows[2][3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"這裡沒有網路。","n":7,"ssz":"......."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].rows[3][0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"判斷句","n":3,"ssz":"..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].rows[3][1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"主語+是/不是","n":7,"ssz":".....1."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].rows[3][2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"誰是不是","n":4,"ssz":"..1."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].rows[3][3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"春天是繁花盛開的季節。","n":11,"ssz":".....1....."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[5].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"　觀察基本句型的形式，可以歸納出還原省略主語的步驟：","n":26,"ssz":"................1........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[6].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"1.找動詞(包括有/沒有、是/不是)或形容詞。\n2.判斷是「誰做什麼」、「誰怎麼樣」、「誰有/沒有」、「誰是/不是」以確認主語","n":63,"ssz":".......1.......1.......................................1......."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[6].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"1.找動詞(包括有/沒有、是/不是)或形容詞。","n":23,"ssz":".......1.......1......."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[6].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"2.判斷是「誰做什麼」、「誰怎麼樣」、「誰有/沒有」、「誰是/不是」以確認主語","n":39,"ssz":"...............................1......."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[7].label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"　　例1：「蓋張素豐，(張)積粟甚富。」","n":20,"ssz":"...................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[7].value","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"1.找到「素豐」跟「積粟甚富」這些形容。\n2.由第一句的「張素豐」判斷，這兩個句子的主語都是張氏，只是第二句省略了主語。","n":60,"ssz":"......................................1.1..................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[7].value#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"1.找到「素豐」跟「積粟甚富」這些形容。","n":20,"ssz":"...................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[7].value#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"2.由第一句的「張素豐」判斷，這兩個句子的主語都是張氏，只是第二句省略了主語。","n":39,"ssz":".................1.1..................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[8].label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"例2：「賈人某，至直隸界，(天)忽大雨雹，(賈人某)伏禾中。」","n":31,"ssz":"..............................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[8].value","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"1.找到「至直隸界」、「大雨雹」、「伏禾中」這些動作。\n2.結合第一句的主語賈人某，判斷是「賈人某至直隸界」、「賈人某伏禾中」；但賈人某無法下冰雹，能下冰雹的是天。","n":82,"ssz":".................................................................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[8].value#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"1.找到「至直隸界」、「大雨雹」、「伏禾中」這些動作。","n":27,"ssz":"..........................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[8].value#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"2.結合第一句的主語賈人某，判斷是「賈人某至直隸界」、「賈人某伏禾中」；但賈人某無法下冰雹，能下冰雹的是天。","n":54,"ssz":"......................................................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[9].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"四、換你試試看","n":7,"ssz":"......."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[10].instruction","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"1.下面的文字取自部分課文，請根據提問判讀主語：\n「雹止，入村，訪問其人，且問取名之義。」","n":45,"ssz":"..........1.................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[10].instruction#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"1.下面的文字取自部分課文，請根據提問判讀主語：","n":24,"ssz":"..........1............."},{"section":"served:s